// Plush Clay Dark: the Plush look in Dark.
// One warm sand surface everywhere; panes are soft raised cards on it, set apart by an even
// 10 pt gap, 16 pt corners and a breath of shade instead of lines. No borders, no glass, no wallpaper. The
// type is a low-contrast ink (7.61:1 over the page, above the 4.5:1 floor) and the one saturated
// accent (#ff8d5e) marks focus, Send, links and the working dot. ANSI colors are solved in OKLCH
// at one lightness over the page (every hue at least 5.21:1). An opt-in look: nothing changes
// until you pick it.
